{"title": "Bleys", "pageid": 2038, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i><b>Bleys</b></i> is a Prince of Yander and shares common parentage with <i><a href=\"/wiki/Shriona\" title=\"Shriona\">Shriona</a></i> and <a href=\"/wiki/Jon\" title=\"Jon\"><i>Jon</i></a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Pavel\" title=\"Pavel\"><i>Pavel</i></a> mentions in <a href=\"/wiki/Nine_Princes_in_Yander\" title=\"Nine Princes in Yander\"><i>Nine Princes&#160;in Yander</i></a>, that Bleys has a blade with portions of the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Pattern\" title=\"The Pattern\"><i>Pattern</i></a> inscribed upon it. Bleys and Pavel attempt to lay seige to Yander but are thwarted by <a href=\"/wiki/Kripke\" title=\"Kripke\"><i>Erics</i></a> use of the <a href=\"/wiki/Jewel_of_Judgement\" title=\"Jewel of Judgement\"><i>Jewel of Judgement</i></a>. Pavel is captured and Bleys falls from Kolvir only being saved by Corwins Trumps .\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Bleys?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260501231329\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 318/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.274      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    2.274      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache 